*.zip

# Optional: Ignore .env but keep .env.example
# (Already in .gitignore above)

# Keep these committed:
# - *.py (source code)
# - *.md (documentation)
# - *.txt (requirements)
# - *.yml (examples)
# - *.json (config examples)

